{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-07-27 06:20:00', 'title': 'LINDE PUBLISHES 2021 SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT REPORT', 'text': 'WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JULY 27, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS PUBLISHED ITS 2021 SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT REPORT. THE 2021 SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT REPORT PROVIDES AN UPDATE ON LINDE\'S PROGRESS TOWARDS ITS SUSTAINABILITY TARGETS, INCLUDING THE AMBITIOUS "35 BY 35" TARGET TO REDUCE ABSOLUTE GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS 35% BY 2035, COMPARED TO THE 2021 BASE.'}